Drop the .mmd files you want to study in here (subfolders are picked up too).

This is the Diagram Lab's corpus root: `pnpm lab` lists exactly what is in this
folder and nothing else. To study a different tree instead, start the server
with MERMAID_LAB_ROOT pointing at it, e.g.

    MERMAID_LAB_ROOT=e2e/platform/dev-diagrams pnpm lab
